        <Geometry x:Key="IconPrev">F1 M6 6h2v12H6zm3.5 6l8.5 6V6z</Geometry>
        <Geometry x:Key="IconClose">F1 M19 6.41L17.59 5 12 10.59 6.41 5 5 6.41 10.59 12 5 17.59 6.41 19 12 13.41 17.59 19 19 17.59 13.41 12z</Geometry>
